#undef NDEBUG
// Review GZ: activity keys over typed XES columns on an XES upload's
// DataFrame and LazyFrame shapes.
//
// - Alpha, the Inductive miner, the log skeleton, the temporal profile and
//   the classic heuristics miner keyed by a column of ints (past int64
//   too), floats, booleans, dates or a mix read the column as read_xes
//   types it and pm4py keys its models: labels are str() of each object
//   (Alpha's targets after shift(): an int64 column's ints become floats),
//   Python-equal objects are one activity, a column's gaps are NaN, NaT or
//   None (Polars: an object column's copy holds str() of each value).
// - Mixed objects raise pm4py's TypeErrors: the Inductive miner's and
//   Declare's sort, the temporal profile's groupby, Inductive's str() of a
//   tree with no-str leaves; pandas Alpha keyed by start_timestamp reads
//   the copy of the timestamp column its DFG step adds.
// - The session keeps each model in the texts the log replays.
//
// Expected values are pm4py 2.7.22 black-box on the same inputs
// (review-harness round-gz: tc/mkgz.py, ct/u64.py).
//
// Usage: minera_server_review_gz_tests <minera_server>

